{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16615","headline":"经湛长史草堂 · 丘丹","name":"经湛长史草堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身退谢名累，道存嘉止足。\n设醴降华幡，挂冠守空谷。\n偶寻野外寺，仰慕贤者躅。\n不见昔簪裾，犹有旧松竹。\n烟霞虽异世，风韵如在瞩。\n余即江海上，归辙青山曲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丘丹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16615.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16615","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}